  "name": "RecordMeta",
  "package": "eventbus",
  "description": "RecordMeta carries Kafka record metadata alongside typed payloads.\n Used by generated Subscribe response wrappers:\n\n   message Subscribe{State}{Field}Record {\n     RecordMeta meta = 1;\n     {FieldType} payload = 2;\n   }\n\n Generated Publish request wrappers use key + headers directly:\n\n   message Publish{State}{Field}Record {\n     string key = 1;\n     map\u003cstring, string\u003e headers = 2;\n     {FieldType} payload = 3;\n   }",
