        "description": "Delegate holds credentials for a service or machine client that can request tokens.\n Each delegate is identified by name (becomes \"sub\" in issued tokens)\n and authenticates via a signed JWT (verified against cred_pairs) or cloud identity.\n\n Two authorization models (mutually exclusive):\n   - S2S: authorized_services → wildcard entitlements per listed service\n   - Profile-based: authorized_profiles → EntitlementProfile → per-service RPC lists\n     Used for machine clients (formerly ApiKey) that need fine-grained access.",
